description=Locks Xiaomi BasedOnCC-VolDown cyclecount_index to index 1 for all cycle counts and defers LowSoh-FvDown until cyclecount >= 801 and raw SOH <= 50 on pudding / OS3.0.319.0.WPCCNXM. Systemless; disable/uninstall + reboot restores stock.
